feeling incredibly mentally refreshed.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.880
In fact, the science around Yoga Nidra is
really impressive, showing that after a

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:55.210
yoga Nidra session, levels of dopamine in
certain areas of the brain are enhanced

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:59.589
by up to 60%, which places the brain and
body into a state of enhanced readiness

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.989
for mental work and for physical work.

